Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.80,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 12: KERJA BAGUS DAN MARI MAKAN KARI!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:54.99,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,PETUALANGAN KITA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:57.18,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,AKAN TERUS BERLANJUT KE MANA PUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:21.79,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,MANDRAGORA, DEWASA, BISA DIMAKAN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.39,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,NAGA BATU - BISA DIMAKAN: SANGAT LEZAT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.33,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,KAKI DEPAN - BISA DIMAKAN: SANGAT LEZAT
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:19.21,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EKOR - BISA DIMAKAN: SANGAT LEZAT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:39.63,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,THE FORSAKEN SAINTESS\NAND HER FOODIE ROADTRIP IN ANOTHER WORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata ada dungeon tersembunyi di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini tugas lain dari Yang Mulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia ingin kita menaklukkan dungeon ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurut Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di dasar dungeon ini ada bola cahaya\Nyang bisa memperkuat kekuatan Gadis Suci
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dia ingin kita mengambilnya lebih dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, yang bisa membuka\Nmekanisme terakhirnya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hanyalah orang yang berasal dari isekai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan kata lain, Rin yang memiliki\Nidentitas sebagai Gadis Suci dan orang asing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selebihnya,\Ntergantung pada sifat dungeon ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Investigasi selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagian dasarnya sangat luas.\NLebih tepatnya, dalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, banyak aura mencurigakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesuai dengan informasi sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumornya ada banyak monster di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakakku sampai menyerahkan\Nkeputusan ini padamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menunjukkan bahwa ini\Nbukan urusan sepele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa saja ini dungeon\Npaling berbahaya yang kita hadapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu yakin ingin bertarung bersama kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dalam gim, ada dungeon yang akan\Nmenewaskan Ville dan tiga lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville dan yang lainnya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebenarnya bukan karakter target,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka hanya figuran tanpa nama\Nyang menjadi pelengkap aktivitas Gadis Suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah itu sudah jelas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga bagian dari Meja Rakus!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau skill-ku bisa membantu kalian,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}manfaatkanlah sebaik-baiknya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku benar-benar menerima ketulusanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.35,0:01:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tidak akan segan mengandalkanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja, kami tak akan membiarkanmu\Nmelakukan hal yang berbahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan melindungimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menghabisi\Npara penjahat dengan cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersiaplah, gim otome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi teman-temanku,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku pasti akan membuatmu\Nmenjadi gim ampas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangankan jalan, pintu pun tidak ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada banyak jenis dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain yang berbentuk dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kadang juga muncul tipe ruangan\Ntertutup seperti ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tipenya seperti ini,\Nkita harus mengungkap mekanismenya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang datang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau mengalahkan seluruh musuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sehingga pintu menuju\Nlantai selanjutnya akan muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini monster klasik\Nyang sering muncul di cerita fantasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sudah dewasa dan bisa bergerak?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baru masuk langsung disambut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, begitu dikalahkan,\Nmereka akan menjerit kencang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini penghalang suara sederhana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa menghalangi jeritan Mandragora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senon, kerja bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, ayo kita segera habisi mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, kamu sembunyi ke belakang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selesai dengan mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka menang jumlah,\Ntapi sebenarnya lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:02:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, apa ini bisa dimakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dimakan, tapi rasanya kurang enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira dengan kemampuan masak Rin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa menikmati sayuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah susah payah bertarung,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti sedih kalau hasil buruannya\Ntak enak dimakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada monster lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat sekali, padahal yang tadi\Nbaru saja kita kalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana pintu ke lantai berikutnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus mencarinya dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, fokuslah mencari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak akan kubiarkan\Nsatu monster pun menyerangmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, tempat ini punya\Nmekanisme seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, dungeon ini
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bukan hanya bisa\Nmemunculkan banyak monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi memunculkannya tanpa henti?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya masih bisa diatasi,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalau terus bertarung sampai dasar,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kehabisan mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dalam gim, ada dungeon yang akan\Nmenewaskan Ville dan tiga lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menemukan pintu masuknya.\NDi sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, semuanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja,\Nregenerasinya terlalu cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin istirahat sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, kita langsung terobos saja.\NCepat naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya, pegangan yang erat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan harap ada\Nyang bisa lewat di depanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski mekanisme dungeon ini rumit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menyebalkan seperti\Nyang ada di dalam gim,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku tidak akan membiarkan
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}satu rekanku yang berharga mati di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sangka,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:05:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku dapat kesempatan berperan serius\Ndan keren seperti ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf membuat kalian menunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini oyakodon Burung Kabut
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan sup miso daging\Ndari daging hewan liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Telurnya sangat lembut\Ndan warnanya juga indah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengilap dan berkilauan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Isi supnya juga banyak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya isinya lebih banyak\Ndaripada kuahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita makan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, mana makananku?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hampir lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf ya, Gomamiso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mengira maaf bisa\Nmenyelesaikan semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu harus minta maaf\Ndengan tulus padaku yang mulia ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang, maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Disebut oyakodon karena dibuat\Ndari daging dan telur Burung Kabut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pilihan namanya bagus, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Telurnya lembut dan halus,\Nbahkan sangat empuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya seperti bisa langsung diminum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasa telurnya sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasa dagingnya lebih ringan,\Njadi tidak enek saat dimakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuahnya juga lembut dan ringan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nasi yang menyerap kuahnya\Njadi sangat lembut dan enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuahnya meresap ke dalam\Npotongan besar sayurannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misonya berpadu sangat pas\Ndengan daging hewan liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski pekat dan kaya rasa, tidak enek!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian juga bisa tambah
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bumbu pedas yang disebut Shichimi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya pasti akan berbeda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah menaburkan\Nbumbu pedas Shichimi ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rasanya jadi makin kompleks, enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana menjelaskannya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dungeon ini benar-benar luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster muncul terus tanpa henti,\Nitu sudah konyol!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski mereka monster lemah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bertarung tanpa henti seperti ini\Ntetap saja melelahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, banyak monster\Nyang memberikan efek status abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hampir kehabisan mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantas saja dungeon ini\Ndianggap sulit oleh kakakku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya pemikiranku\Nyang terlalu naif.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kekuatan, mental,\Ndan persediaan kita
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terus terkuras,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lalu kehabisan tenaga\Ndi tengah perjalanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membayangkannya saja sudah menakutkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awalnya kupikir drop item bisa\Nmenambah persediaan makanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi nyatanya tak ada waktu\Nuntuk mengambilnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski sudah kuulang ini berkali-kali,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}skill Rin memang tidak masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sangka,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita bisa santai dan memulihkan tenaga\Ndi tengah kerumunan monster
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tanpa terdeteksi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Singkatnya, skill-mu justru lebih hebat\Ndaripada dungeon ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill Rin, Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar hebat, aku sangat suka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kali ini kamu kumaafkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga hebat, kamu boleh memelukku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tadi tekadku sudah serius.\NSekarang dia pergi ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak ada di sini,\Nmungkin dia sudah pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, kita lanjutkan penaklukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo semuanya, semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Baik!\N- Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat tidak bisa menggunakan Mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku pasti jadi beban untuk kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah banyak membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkatmu, kami bisa sampai sejauh ini\Ndalam kondisi terbaik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suasananya langsung terasa berbeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat ini mungkin bagian dasar\Ndungeon ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya tidak bisa dibuka paksa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan sihir pun tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini mekanisme yang hanya bisa dibuka\Noleh orang dari isekai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kucoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luas sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya tidak ada jebakan\Natau mekanisme di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari informasi Yang Mulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harusnya ada monster\Nyang menjaga bola cahaya di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tidak ada siapa pun di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.27,0:09:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tempat yang paling mencurigakan\Nsaat ini adalah altar ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa di sini ada bekas sesuatu\Nyang pernah dibakar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dewa yang aku yakini berbeda,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:10:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi konon dulu ada tradisi membakar\Npersembahan untuk dewa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pola atau tulisan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dalam bahasa kuno, artinya\N"persembahkanlah pengorbanan".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudnya pengorbanan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya domba atau sapi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daging?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, kita masih punya sisa daging?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum sampai di sini,\Ndagingnya hampir habis kita makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya nasi putih dan tepung\Nyang bisa diisi ulang otomatis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, mundurlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak terjadi apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira bos dungeon-nya akan keluar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan kita disuruh ke sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kuladeni.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Noah juga pernah bilang,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}begitu bos dungeon dikalahkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jalan untuk melanjutkan\Nperjalanan akan terbuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sederhananya,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita hanya perlu melewati rintangannya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ayo masuk dan hajar bosnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah gaya kita, Meja Rakus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak perlu banyak berpikir,\Nterus maju!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar hanya mengandalkan otot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, ini memang gaya Ville\Ndan yang lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, apa rencanamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski kutanya begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu pasti akan bilang mau ikut, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, jangan suruh aku tetap di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biarkan aku pergi bersama kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja Rin harus ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tak tahu apa yang akan\Nterjadi di depan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}selain rasa takut dan penasaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar perasaan yang aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiap kali memasuki tempat baru,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rasanya jadi berdebar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena kita petualang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petualang...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga petualang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, ayo kita masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Baik!\N- Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Go-Gomamiso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan melamun begitu, fokus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, gunakan skill-mu untuk sembunyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kita terluka parah saat tiba di sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}embusan napas tadi\Nmungkin bisa menghabisi kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayangnya, berkat Rin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kondisi stamina, mental, dan sihir
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita semua dalam kondisi terbaik!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beraninya kamu menyerang\Ndiam-diam dan membuat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}koki berharga kami kaget!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pantas dihukum mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga sangat marah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Gomamiso.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga pemburu hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tidak sesulit\Nmenghadapi Naga Ilusi Merlova,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kekuatannya luar biasa besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Esti Gard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aria!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aria, kamu tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak apa-apa, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perhatikan waktu dan tempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Myuriela Veil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini rasanya bertarung melawan naga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada hal yang bisa kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat lezat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat lezat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, di sini berbahaya!\NSembunyi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:14:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga itu sepertinya sangat enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menu makan malam ini kita adalah naga!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, aku maju!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.51,0:14:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Horizontal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakimu kelihatannya enak untuk dimakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rekan setimku ternyata kuat gila.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak punya dendam padamu, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu tak tumbang,\Nkami tak bisa makan—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tak bisa melanjutkan perjalanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, tapi kami punya alasan\Nuntuk tidak boleh kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami, Meja Rakus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}meraih kemenangan\Nberkat ikatan persahabatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah dipikir,\Nkita menang karena nafsu makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, jangan-jangan ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih awam soal ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bukankah kita harus mempersembahkan\Ndaging Naga Batu itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mempersembahkan dagingnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal ini drop item yang sangat langka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau dipersembahkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}persembahkan padaku yang mulia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya kita hanya bisa berdoa\Nagar tak perlu mempersembahkan semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Po-Pokoknya, kita coba dulu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita mulai dari kotak ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita hanya perlu meletakkannya\Nsampai altarnya bereaksi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya, sisakan bagian yang paling enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba kulihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kaki depan kalau dimasak perlahan\Nbisa lembut sampai lumer di mulut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ekornya mungkin gurih dijadikan kaldu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bimbang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini daging jantung?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dijadikan persembahan,\Njantung biasanya umum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa tiba-tiba bercahaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville, ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, ini pasti yang dimaksud kakakku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bola cahaya yang bisa meningkatkan\Nkekuatan Gadis Suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dagingnya... hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aria, jangan sedih!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada daging yang tersisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi benda inilah
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville dan yang lainnya di dalam gim...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, bukan apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita dapat bola cahayanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekali lagi, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan hanya membawa semuanya selamat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu juga menyelesaikan misi dengan lancar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sangka dungeon itu\Nterus memunculkan monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pembuat gim ini penuh dengan niat jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penilaianmu tanpa ampun, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sekarang Ville...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Krisis yang mengancam nyawa adikku\Nharusnya sepenuhnya teratasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:18:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini aku selalu cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap hari cemas\Nkapan alur ceritanya berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, mulai hari ini,\Naku tidak perlu cemas lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perasaanku juga sama sepertimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski ini dunia gim,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville dan yang lainnya hidup di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bukan sekadar karakter figuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka teman-teman berharga bagiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Laporan untuk misi ini\Nharusnya sudah beres, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa wajahmu murung begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak, sikapmu tidak biasa begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begini, aku ini raja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, cepat kemari\Nuntuk membuat penutupnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dan yang lainnya sudah tidak sabar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Intinya begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga mau ikut?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.82,0:18:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini skill-mu yang membuat Ville\Ndan lainnya berhasil menaklukkan dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ville bilang kamu mengizinkan kami\Nmemakai taman kerajaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi sekalian, kamu juga harus ikut\Nmerayakan kemenangan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, itu bukan masalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang bisa menahan aroma ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, belum matang?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bisa seharum ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlalu menggoda,\Nrasanya aku akan tersedot masuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak menggunakan sihir pemikat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai bisa kutukar,\Nmungkin keyakinanku akan kulepas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, tahanlah, Senon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin meminumnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tenggorokanku terbakar.\NAku ingin meminumnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku anak baik yang bisa menunggu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi sekarang mungkin berubah\Njadi anak nakal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi penduduk isekai, kari menakutkan\Nseperti senjata andalan, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, aku merebus kaki depan\NNaga Batu sampai dagingnya lumer di mulut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sebelumnya pernah bilang\Ningin makan kari, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:20:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami juga harus memberimu apresiasi\Nkarena sudah bekerja keras selama ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, pesta kari dari isekai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}resmi dimulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini dia!\NRasa ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untung aku bawa bumbu kari instan\Nsaat pergi berkemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini agak pedas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku tak bisa berhenti!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasa gurih yang kuat ini\Ndari rebusan daging naga?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana aku bisa menganggap\Nserius naga nantinya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saus karinya saja sudah sangat kuat,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi begitu dimakan dengan nasi putih,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rasanya langsung berbeda!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daging dan sayur yang banyak\Ndan berukuran besar,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ditambah kuah kari\Nyang kental dan nasi putih,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.97,0:20:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ini benar-benar kombinasi terbaik!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau berenang ke dalam saus karinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begini, keunggulan sudah jauh\Nberpihak pada kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal Gadis Suci, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kamu tak perlu\Nmencemaskan masalah ini lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama terus bertualang dengan mereka,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tanpa sadar kamu akan mengacaukan\Nalur cerita lain di gim ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.53,0:21:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa menyangkalnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin, kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kakakku menyusahkanmu lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bicara apa kamu ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah kenyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tidak bicara aneh lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia hanya bilang
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku boleh terus bertualang bersama kalian
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seperti sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalian akan kembali terseret\Nmasalah Gadis Suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, padahal kamu juga korban.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang jangan dipikirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski nantinya terseret masalah,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita akan cari jalan keluarnya bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah arti dari tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak mau bersama kami lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih ingin pergi ke banyak tempat\Nbersama kalian,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mencicipi berbagai macam hidangan lezat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menikmati isekai ini sepuasnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti, sudah diputuskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami juga tidak bisa hidup tanpamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ini juga petunjuk dari dewaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan terus bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi Aria itu milikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan pernah meninggalkanku sendiri, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gomamiso.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah ke depannya kami\Nyang akan merepotkanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu tetap ingin ikut kami,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.75,0:22:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Petualangan Meja Rakus
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}baru saja dimulai!
